{
  "$comment": [
    "ONE assistant message, carried across every hop that touches its identity.",
    "",
    "The message holds TWO content blocks — a thinking block at API index 0 and a",
    "text block at API index 1 — because that is the shape the whole class of",
    "identity bugs hides in. A single-block message reconciles even when the two",
    "sides disagree about what a block index means, so it proves nothing.",
    "",
    "Note what the SDK does with `content`: it emits ONE assistant record PER",
    "BLOCK, both repeating `msg_01ABC` and each carrying a `content` array of",
    "length one. So a record's own content index is always 0 and identifies",
    "nothing, while the live deltas number the blocks 0 and 1. Any hop that",
    "re-derives identity from the wrong one of those two ordinals reproduces the",
    "bug this fixture exists to catch.",
    "",
    "Consumed by:",
    "  agent-shim/claude/shim/test/stream-contract.test.ts  (sdkMessages -> wire)",
    "  daemon/internal/frontend/stream_contract_test.go     (wire -> frames)",
    "  webapp/test/stream-contract.test.ts                  (frames -> store)",
    "Each hop asserts against the SAME fixture, so drift at any one of them fails",
    "in CI instead of rendering twice on screen."
  ],

  "sessionId": "s1",
  "workspace": "ws",
  "messageId": "msg_01ABC",
  "tsMs": "1700000000000",

  "sdkMessages": [
    {
      "type": "stream_event",
      "session_id": "s1",
      "uuid": "evt-1",
      "event": {
        "type": "message_start",
        "message": { "id": "msg_01ABC", "role": "assistant", "content": [] }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stream_event",
      "session_id": "s1",
      "uuid": "evt-2",
      "event": {
        "type": "content_block_delta",
        "index": 0,
        "delta": { "type": "thinking_delta", "thinking": "weigh" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stream_event",
      "session_id": "s1",
      "uuid": "evt-3",
      "event": {
        "type": "content_block_delta",
        "index": 0,
        "delta": { "type": "thinking_delta", "thinking": "ing it" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stream_event",
      "session_id": "s1",
      "uuid": "evt-4",
      "event": {
        "type": "content_block_delta",
        "index": 1,
        "delta": { "type": "text_delta", "text": "Hel" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stream_event",
      "session_id": "s1",
      "uuid": "evt-5",
      "event": {
        "type": "content_block_delta",
        "index": 1,
        "delta": { "type": "text_delta", "text": "lo" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "assistant",
      "session_id": "s1",
      "uuid": "env-1",
      "message": {
        "id": "msg_01ABC",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": [{ "type": "thinking", "thinking": "weighing it", "signature": "sig" }],
        "usage": {
          "input_tokens": 0,
          "output_tokens": 0,
          "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0,
          "cache_read_input_tokens": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "assistant",
      "session_id": "s1",
      "uuid": "env-2",
      "message": {
        "id": "msg_01ABC",
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Hello" }],
        "usage": {
          "input_tokens": 0,
          "output_tokens": 0,
          "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0,
          "cache_read_input_tokens": 0
        }
      }
    }
  ],

  "frontendFrames": [
    {
      "typingDelta": {
        "workspace": "ws",
        "sessionId": "s1",
        "delta": { "uuid": "msg_01ABC", "blockIndex": 0, "thinking": "weigh" }
      }
    },
    {
      "typingDelta": {
        "workspace": "ws",
        "sessionId": "s1",
        "delta": { "uuid": "msg_01ABC", "blockIndex": 0, "thinking": "ing it" }
      }
    },
    {
      "typingDelta": {
        "workspace": "ws",
        "sessionId": "s1",
        "delta": { "uuid": "msg_01ABC", "blockIndex": 1, "text": "Hel" }
      }
    },
    {
      "typingDelta": {
        "workspace": "ws",
        "sessionId": "s1",
        "delta": { "uuid": "msg_01ABC", "blockIndex": 1, "text": "lo" }
      }
    },
    {
      "conversationDelta": {
        "workspace": "ws",
        "sessionId": "s1",
        "throughSeq": "1",
        "items": [
          {
            "uuid": "env-1",
            "tsMs": "1700000000000",
            "assistantMessage": {
              "id": "msg_01ABC",
              "content": [{ "thinking": { "thinking": "weighing it", "signature": "sig" } }]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "conversationDelta": {
        "workspace": "ws",
        "sessionId": "s1",
        "throughSeq": "2",
        "items": [
          {
            "uuid": "env-2",
            "tsMs": "1700000000000",
            "assistantMessage": {
              "id": "msg_01ABC",
              "content": [{ "text": { "text": "Hello" } }]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],

  "expectItems": [
    { "kind": "thinking", "text": "weighing it", "done": true, "messageId": "msg_01ABC", "blockId": "msg_01ABC:0" },
    { "kind": "text", "text": "Hello", "done": true, "messageId": "msg_01ABC", "blockId": "msg_01ABC:1" }
  ]
}
